sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Client as Client App
    participant API as Auth API
    participant RL as Rate Limiter
    participant DB as User DB
    participant JWT as JWT Session Service

    User->>Client: Enter email and password
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>RL: Check request limit
    RL-->>API: Allowed

    API->>DB: Find user by email
    DB-->>API: User record

    API->>API: Verify bcrypt password
    alt Invalid credentials
        API-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    else Valid credentials
        API->>JWT: Create session payload
        JWT-->>API: Session token data
        API-->>Client: 200 Login success
    end
